---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Supporters"
  description="The people, institutions, and organizations who believe in what Ryzo Studios is building — and help make it possible."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="sup-hero">
    <div class="sup-hero-bg"></div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sup-hero-content">
        <span class="eyebrow">Supporters</span>
        <h1 class="display">Support the work.</h1>
        <p class="sup-hero-body">We're building alongside foundations, companies, and individuals who wanted this made carefully and measured honestly.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Partners -->
  <section class="section sup-partners-section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Partners</span>
      <h2 class="subheadline">With gratitude.</h2>

      <div class="sup-partners">

        <div class="sup-partner">
          <h3 class="sup-partner-label">Impact Partners</h3>
          <p>Equimundo and the Caring Masculinities Fund were lead partners on Rage Fighters, and true collaborators in getting story and practice into the places young people already are.</p>
          <a href="https://www.equimundo.org/caring-masculinity-fund/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="sup-link">Visit Equimundo</a>
        </div>

        <div class="sup-partner">
          <h3 class="sup-partner-label">Technology Partners</h3>
          <p>Autodesk, Unreal, Perforce, and Roblox provide software donations and technical support across our whole pipeline.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sup-partner">
          <h3 class="sup-partner-label">Events Partners</h3>
          <p>The Clubhouse Network is our live events partner, connecting kids and teens with new ways to use their creativity and take on big emotions through art, film, and gaming.</p>
          <a href="https://www.clubhousenetwork.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="sup-link">Visit The Clubhouse Network</a>
        </div>

        <div class="sup-partner">
          <h3 class="sup-partner-label">Advisors</h3>
          <p>The Digital Wellness Lab at Boston Children's Hospital helps us check our impact math and improve our measurement tools.</p>
          <a href="https://digitalwellnesslab.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="sup-link">Visit the Digital Wellness Lab</a>
        </div>

        <div class="sup-partner">
          <h3 class="sup-partner-label">Community Supporters</h3>
          <p class="sup-partner-highlight">The ones who showed up first.</p>
          <p>Early believers who got us through the studio's first stages through Kickstarter and private donations. Their conviction, before the proof points existed, made everything else possible.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Commitments -->
  <section class="section sup-commitments-section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Commitments</span>
      <h2 class="subheadline">Commitments.</h2>
      <p class="body-lg sup-commitment-body">
        Ryzo Studios is a signatory of the Inspired Internet Pledge, a public commitment
        to make the internet a safer, healthier place for young people, convened by the
        Digital Wellness Lab.
      </p>
      <a href="https://inspiredinternet.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Read the Pledge</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Giving -->
  <section class="section sup-giving-section" id="donate">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sup-giving-grid">
        <div class="sup-giving-main">
          <span class="eyebrow">Giving</span>
          <h2 class="subheadline">Give kids stories built for them.</h2>
          <p class="body-lg">
            Every gift goes into the work: story worlds built across film, games, and live
            events. Right now that means deepening our first franchise for boys and starting
            development on our second.
          </p>
          <a
            href="https://secure.lglforms.com/form_engine/s/Vl4n9NT5Rdj2w6OylYlQXw"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="btn btn-primary"
          >Donate</a>
          <p class="sup-fine-print">
            Processed securely by Youth Media Foundation, a 501(c)(3) nonprofit and our fiscal
            sponsor, on behalf of Ryzo Studios. Card and check gifts are tax-deductible and
            you'll receive a receipt. 100% of every gift reaches the work.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="sup-giving-other">
          <h3 class="sup-other-heading">Other ways to give</h3>

          <div class="sup-other-method">
            <h4>Donor-advised fund</h4>
            <p>Recommend a grant to Youth Media Foundation, EIN 99-1282698, 888 7th Avenue, 29th Floor, New York, NY 10106. In the purpose or special instructions field, write: <strong>Ryzo Studios</strong>. Without it, your grant may not reach us.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="sup-other-method">
            <h4>Check</h4>
            <p>Payable to Youth Media Foundation, 888 7th Avenue, 29th Floor, New York, NY 10106, with <strong>Ryzo Studios</strong> in the memo line.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="sup-other-method">
            <h4>Stock, wire, or ACH</h4>
            <p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@ryzo.studio" class="sup-inline-link">hello@ryzo.studio</a> and we'll send instructions.</p>
          </div>

          <p class="sup-fine-print">
            Ryzo Studios is a supported program of Youth Media Foundation.
            <a href="https://www.youthmediafoundation.org/supported-programs" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="sup-inline-link">See our page on their site</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* ─── Shared ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .section {
    background: linear-gradient(to right, #080316 0%, #1c0832 100%);
  }

  /* ─── Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .sup-hero {
    min-height: 72vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    padding-block: 8rem 5rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .sup-hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: url('/images/supporters/hero-bg.png');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center 30%;
    transform: scaleX(-1);
  }

  .sup-hero-bg::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(5,2,18,0.75) 0%, rgba(5,2,18,0.55) 40%, rgba(5,2,18,0.10) 65%, rgba(5,2,18,0) 100%),
      linear-gradient(to top, #080316 0%, rgba(8,3,22,0.5) 20%, transparent 45%);
  }

  .sup-hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .sup-hero-content .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .display {
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 10vw, 9rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .sup-hero-body {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.2rem);
    color: var(--fg-2);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* ─── Partners ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .sup-partners-section {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  }

  .sup-partners-section .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .sup-partners-section .subheadline { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }

  .sup-partners {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  }

  .sup-partner {
    padding: 2rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .sup-partner:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .sup-partner-label {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .sup-partner p {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--fg-2);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .sup-partner-highlight {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--fg) !important;
    font-size: var(--text-base) !important;
  }

  .sup-link {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    transition: color var(--transition);
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  .sup-link:hover { color: var(--accent-light); }

  /* ─── Commitments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .sup-commitments-section {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  }

  .sup-commitments-section .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .sup-commitments-section .subheadline { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }

  .sup-commitment-body {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* ─── Giving ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .sup-giving-section {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  }

  .sup-giving-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .sup-giving-main {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .sup-giving-main .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .sup-giving-other {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .sup-other-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--fg);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .sup-other-method {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .sup-other-method h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .sup-other-method p {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--fg-2);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .sup-other-method strong {
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .sup-fine-print {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--fg-3);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .sup-inline-link {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    transition: color var(--transition);
  }

  .sup-inline-link:hover { color: var(--accent-light); }

  /* ─── Responsive ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .sup-giving-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
